    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take back the Earth in a high-stakes action RTS where humanity fights for survival. Battle swarms of giant, radiation-mutated bugs as you reclaim the surface with advanced technology, tactical turret placement, and strategic defenses. Every decision counts as you push back the infestation and fight to restore what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you have access to turrets that can be placed on any ground tile\u2014design your base however you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: defend headquarters at all costs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will come in waves from spawners, each with different methods of attack, so stay vigilant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful\u2014they can even destroy the structures you\u2019ve placed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a 10-level campaign and an endless mode to truly test your skills\u2026 the question is, can you handle it?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take back the Earth in a high-stakes action RTS where humanity fights for survival. Battle swarms of giant, radiation-mutated bugs as you reclaim the surface with advanced technology, tactical turret placement, and strategic defenses. Every decision counts as you push back the infestation and fight to restore what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you have access to turrets that can be placed on any ground tile\u2014design your base however you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: defend headquarters at all costs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will come in waves from spawners, each with different methods of attack, so stay vigilant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful\u2014they can even destroy the structures you\u2019ve placed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a 10-level campaign and an endless mode to truly test your skills\u2026 the question is, can you handle it?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A pixelated 2.5D RTS meets tower defense as you battle mutated ants in a short campaign. Build walls, place turrets, and hold the line to reclaim Earth's surface in this tactical fight for survival where placement of everything matters.",
